Welcome to the unit Animals in the Wild A.

2
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:09,060
How much do you know about wild animals?

3
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:12,560
Write the correct names under the pictures.

4
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:19,610
Then listen to the introductions to learn more about these animals. 1.

5
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:23,380
I'm big, brown and brave.

6
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:25,290
I have large wings.

7
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:33,470
I have good eyes and can see my food from way up high. 2.

8
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:35,770
I live in the ocean.

9
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:40,420
My skin is smooth and I have a pointed mouth.

10
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:42,720
I'm usually grey in colour.

11
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,920
I really like to play.

12
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:50,940
I can jump high out of the water. 3.

13
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:54,390
I live in Africa in a big group.

14
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:57,210
I eat grass and small plants.

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:01,240
I have a long neck and I look like a horse.

16
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:06,620
I am black and white. 4.

17
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:11,070
I have a pointed face and look like a wolf.

18
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:13,040
My legs are thin.

19
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:20,820
I'm usually red in colour and I often sleep in a hole in the ground. 5.

20
00:01:20,820 --> 00:01:23,390
I like to live in groups.

21
00:01:23,390 --> 00:01:26,480
I can hear and smell things far away.

22
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:32,990
I can run for hours without stopping. 6.

23
00:01:32,990 --> 00:01:36,930
I live in the ocean. I'm large.

24
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,910
I have no bones.

25
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:43,680
I eat a lot and I have about 3,000 teeth.

26
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:47,140
My sense of smell is much better than humans.
